{"hymn":"SY11","parent":"NS10001","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"Déjame estar tras de Ti","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":["Dé","i"],"n2":["ja","m"],"n3":["me‿es","m"],"n4":["tar","t"],"n5":"tras","n6":"de","n8":"Ti,","n9":"Con","n10":"mis","n11":["lá","i"],"n12":["gri","m"],"n13":["mas","t"],"n14":"la‿var","n15":"Tus","n16":"pies,","n17":"Con","n18":"mi","n19":["glo","i"],"n21":["ria,","t"],"n22":["Te‿a","i"],"n23":["ma","m"],"n24":["ré,","t"],"n25":"Al","n26":["be","i"],"n27":["sar","m"],"n29":["los","t"],"n30":"y","n31":["un","i"],"n32":["gir","m"],"n33":["los","t"],"n34":"con","n35":["Un","i"],"n36":["güen","m"],"n38":["to.","t"],"n40":"¡Te","n41":["a","i"],"n43":["mo!","t"],"n45":["¡Je","i"],"n46":["sús,","t"],"n47":"yo","n48":["Te‿a","i"],"n50":["mo!","t"],"n52":["Mi‿a","i"],"n53":["mor‿y","t"],"n54":["glo","i"],"n55":["ria","t"],"n56":["des","i"],"n57":["per","m"],"n58":["di","m"],"n60":["cio‿en","t"],"n61":"Ti.","n63":["Re","i"],"n64":["ci","m"],"n65":["be","t"],"n66":"mi","n67":["un","i"],"n68":["güen","m"],"n70":["to,","t"],"n72":"Es","n73":"mi","n74":["to","i"],"n75":["do","t"],"n76":["pa","i"],"n77":["ra","t"],"n78":"Ti.","n80":"¡El","n81":"más","n82":["pre","i"],"n83":["cio","m"],"n84":["so","t"],"n85":["e","i"],"n86":["res!","t"],"n87":["Te‿a","i"],"n88":["mo,","t"],"n89":["Se","i"],"n90":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Déjame ungir Tus pies","Con ungüento de gran valor,","Enjugarlos en amor,","Y la casa sea llenada con fragancia."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Dicen que si fueras profeta,","Debías saber lo que soy,","Pecadora tocándote.","Soy mujer que no es digna de ungirte."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Que mi amor, Señor, unja Tus pies,","Mis cabellos los secarán;","Y besar donde entrarán los clavos;","Mi todo desperdicio en Ti."]}]}